WEBVTT

00:00:25.930 --> 00:00:30.180
N- No.17!

00:00:30.270 --> 00:00:32.560
Why, you...

00:00:35.610 --> 00:00:38.190
What are you doing?!

00:00:38.270 --> 00:00:41.230
I am the one who created you-

00:00:45.910 --> 00:00:50.790
You miserable pile of junk!

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:02.920
Doctor Gero was killed by
Artificial Human No.17,

00:01:03.010 --> 00:01:05.260
whom he himself had built.

00:01:05.340 --> 00:01:06.720
However...

00:01:11.020 --> 00:01:15.190
...the computer that Doctor Gero
had been using continued to operate,

00:01:15.270 --> 00:01:22.610
in order to create the
mightiest of all artificial humans.

00:01:48.590 --> 00:01:53.850
Break through the shining clouds,
and fly away (fly away)

00:01:53.930 --> 00:02:00.940
As a panorama spreads itself
throughout my being!

00:02:01.020 --> 00:02:06.280
The earth, having been kicked
in the face, gets angry (angry)!

00:02:06.360 --> 00:02:12.830
And makes one of its
volcanoes explode!

00:02:12.910 --> 00:02:19.500
If, within the thawed polar ice,

00:02:19.580 --> 00:02:28.510
There is a dinosaur, then I  want
to train him to balance atop a ball.

00:02:28.590 --> 00:02:32.180
CHA-LA-HEAD-CHA-LA

00:02:32.260 --> 00:02:41.190
No matter what may happen,
I  feel as though nothing can bother me,

00:02:41.270 --> 00:02:44.520
CHA-LA-HEAD-CHA-LA

00:02:44.610 --> 00:02:50.490
However hard your chest pounds,
the Genki Dama will roar!

00:02:50.570 --> 00:02:53.830
CHA-LA-HEAD-CHA-LA

00:02:53.910 --> 00:03:02.920
The emptier your head is, the more
room there is to pack with dreams,

00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:06.590
CHA-LA-HEAD-CHA-LA

00:03:06.670 --> 00:03:13.510
With a cheerful face and an Ultra-Z,
today is ai-yai-yai-yai-yai...

00:03:13.600 --> 00:03:15.470
Sparking!

00:04:04.560 --> 00:04:09.530
"Miss 'World's Most Beautiful Girl'
World Competition"

00:04:12.280 --> 00:04:15.070
Hey, Oolong, aren't they
going to start this soon?

00:04:15.160 --> 00:04:16.660
You're a fine one to talk.

00:04:16.740 --> 00:04:18.740
They said it's going to be
held at 7:00 in the evening.

00:04:18.830 --> 00:04:23.080
It was a certain dirty old man that
wanted to line up for it now, I believe.

00:04:23.170 --> 00:04:25.420
It's the ones who sit in the very front

00:04:25.500 --> 00:04:27.840
that get to see the
pichi-pichi gals the best, you know!

00:04:27.920 --> 00:04:28.840
After all,

00:04:28.920 --> 00:04:32.420
this is the Miss "World's Most
Beautiful Girl" World Competition!

00:04:32.510 --> 00:04:36.140
Just imagining it makes my blood pressure rise!

00:04:43.520 --> 00:04:45.190
To be able to get young pichi-pichi gals

00:04:45.270 --> 00:04:47.860
to play pafu-pafu with me
after going so long without...

00:04:47.940 --> 00:04:50.400
Pichi-pichi gals, huh?

00:05:00.910 --> 00:05:06.500
You guys!  Both of you, cut it
out with your indecent thoughts!

00:05:06.580 --> 00:05:09.840
We're in front of Trunks here, aren't we?

00:05:09.920 --> 00:05:13.760
Um, Kuririn-san, I don't particularly...

00:05:13.840 --> 00:05:16.430
You guys are going to corrupt
this young man's purity of heart!

00:05:16.510 --> 00:05:18.090
Ha!  You're a fine one to say so!

00:05:18.180 --> 00:05:21.770
Kuririn!  What was all that earlier?

00:05:21.850 --> 00:05:24.480
There's no use for us to line up here!

00:05:24.560 --> 00:05:26.770
Let's go peek into the changing rooms!
Quickly, let's go!

00:05:26.850 --> 00:05:30.110
We might be able to peek in at
a girl changing into her swimsuit!

00:05:30.190 --> 00:05:35.450
Ah, I wonder, are there going to be
any cute girls that would be my bride?!

00:05:35.530 --> 00:05:38.950
O- oh, no, that was a just a gag!

00:05:39.030 --> 00:05:41.740
That was obviously just a gag, wasn't it?

00:05:41.830 --> 00:05:47.080
I aim to be a martial artist that can
also let fly with the gags, you know!

00:05:47.170 --> 00:05:50.420
Well, Oolong, let's go peek into
the dressing rooms, just you and I!

00:05:50.500 --> 00:05:53.420
Sure thing!  Kuririn, keep our places for us!

00:05:53.510 --> 00:05:56.970
Come on, now!  I'm going to tell the police!

00:06:00.600 --> 00:06:03.850
Trunks... sorry, man!
Hold our places, okay?

00:06:03.930 --> 00:06:05.850
Kuririn-san!

00:06:05.940 --> 00:06:08.850
What am I going to do with them?

00:06:08.940 --> 00:06:12.820
I wish Goku-san and the others
would finish shopping already.

00:06:19.490 --> 00:06:22.740
I had that one first!

00:06:22.830 --> 00:06:28.080
Gohan, why do women love
shopping as much as this?

00:06:28.170 --> 00:06:32.750
In Mother's case, it looks like
she uses shopping to relieve stress.

00:06:32.840 --> 00:06:34.420
Maybe that's it...

00:06:34.510 --> 00:06:37.050
Goku-sa, take these too!

00:06:42.510 --> 00:06:44.760
Are you finished now, ChiChi?

00:06:44.850 --> 00:06:46.850
Next up are clothes for you, Goku-sa!

00:06:46.930 --> 00:06:49.190
You wear the same thing all year round!

00:06:49.270 --> 00:06:51.810
You're goin' to dress up once in a while!

00:07:16.840 --> 00:07:19.130
...I'm just a bit run-down, that's all-

00:08:05.600 --> 00:08:07.640
Son Goku...

00:08:07.930 --> 00:08:11.350
"Good fortune"

00:08:11.440 --> 00:08:14.190
Kuririn and the others sure goofed up!

00:08:14.270 --> 00:08:17.440
To think they were off by a whole day!

00:08:17.530 --> 00:08:20.400
I thought it was kind of strange, you know?

00:08:20.490 --> 00:08:22.780
I mean, nobody was lining up, except for us.

00:08:22.860 --> 00:08:25.820
Well, we'll just have to
look forward to tomorrow.

00:08:42.510 --> 00:08:43.300
Welcome-

00:09:17.960 --> 00:09:20.800
-What's wrong?
-What's the matter?

00:09:37.860 --> 00:09:44.110
Gohan, you've got to eat more!
You'll never grow up, otherwise!

00:09:44.200 --> 00:09:47.740
I just can't keep up with Father's appetite.

00:09:47.820 --> 00:09:49.910
You should stop eatin'
before you get stuffed.

00:09:49.990 --> 00:09:52.740
If you eat too much, then the blood
stops circulatin' to your head, you know.

00:09:52.830 --> 00:09:55.120
And that gets in the way of studyin'.

00:10:06.180 --> 00:10:10.090
'Scuse me, can I get another helping?

00:10:18.520 --> 00:10:20.770
Son Goku!

00:10:20.860 --> 00:10:23.230
Son Goku...

00:10:39.830 --> 00:10:40.960
Father!

00:11:06.280 --> 00:11:09.030
G- Gohan, don't you let go!

00:11:24.500 --> 00:11:28.800
Who is it that did all this?

00:11:48.860 --> 00:11:52.110
Gohan, get ChiChi to safety!
Kuririn, Trunks, you too!

00:11:52.200 --> 00:11:54.740
Get everyone as far
away from me as you can!

00:11:54.830 --> 00:11:57.080
Ah!  Those high heels were expensive!

00:11:57.160 --> 00:11:58.790
Mother!

00:12:13.180 --> 00:12:15.930
Sure enough, it looks
like they're only after me.

00:12:25.520 --> 00:12:27.570
Who are you guys?

00:12:37.490 --> 00:12:44.290
Seeing as how I can't sense any
ki from you, you ain't human, huh?

00:12:49.840 --> 00:12:56.430
I get it. That means that you're artificial
humans, created by Doctor Gero, huh?

00:12:56.510 --> 00:12:59.220
He doesn't give up easily, does he?

00:14:10.250 --> 00:14:11.380
Goku-san!

00:14:11.920 --> 00:14:13.550
Trunks!

00:14:27.520 --> 00:14:31.770
Goku-san!  If we fight here,
the casualties will just increase!

00:14:31.860 --> 00:14:35.440
Let's fly off to the glacial belt to
the north, where no one else is around!

00:14:35.530 --> 00:14:36.440
All right!

00:14:36.530 --> 00:14:38.150
You guys, come on!

00:14:58.260 --> 00:15:00.180
Kuririn-san!

00:15:00.260 --> 00:15:02.510
Gohan, unfortunately,

00:15:02.600 --> 00:15:04.850
it doesn't look like we have
any part to play this time.

00:15:04.930 --> 00:15:06.850
Our levels are too different.

00:15:06.930 --> 00:15:11.520
But still, we might be of
some use to them!  I'm going!

00:15:11.610 --> 00:15:13.230
--Gohan!
-No you don't!

00:15:16.190 --> 00:15:19.820
Startin' tomorrow, you've got
summer cram school courses, don't you?!

00:15:19.910 --> 00:15:21.780
We've already paid the tuition!

00:15:21.870 --> 00:15:22.740
B- but...

00:15:22.820 --> 00:15:24.370
Durin' this summer vacation,

00:15:24.450 --> 00:15:28.080
you promised me you
would study, didn't you?!

00:15:28.160 --> 00:15:30.830
Mother, between studying and Father's life,

00:15:30.920 --> 00:15:33.750
which is more important?!

00:15:33.840 --> 00:15:35.460
Ah, Gohan!

00:15:37.840 --> 00:15:40.050
See here, Gohan!

00:15:44.180 --> 00:15:45.510
Gohan!

00:15:46.520 --> 00:15:47.770
ChiChi-san...

00:15:47.850 --> 00:15:51.440
I know well how Gohan must feel.

00:15:51.520 --> 00:15:53.400
Kuririn!

00:15:55.520 --> 00:15:59.570
What are you dawdlin' around for?!
You've got to get goin'!

00:16:02.280 --> 00:16:03.530
Hurry up and go!

00:16:03.620 --> 00:16:04.570
Ee-yow!

00:16:06.910 --> 00:16:10.200
Kuririn, be careful, okay?

00:16:11.920 --> 00:16:16.340
Damn. Looks like I'll never
find a bride in this lifetime.

00:16:41.860 --> 00:16:44.530
Son Goku...

00:17:11.270 --> 00:17:14.770
Nobody should have to hold back here!

00:17:14.850 --> 00:17:15.770
Now, come on!

00:17:15.850 --> 00:17:19.020
I won't let you lay a finger on Goku-san!

00:17:26.200 --> 00:17:28.320
Trunks...

00:17:35.170 --> 00:17:36.460
Trunks!

00:18:01.270 --> 00:18:03.030
G- Goku-san!

00:18:10.580 --> 00:18:15.500
Not even Son Goku is able to fight
the way he had hoped, it seems.

00:18:42.190 --> 00:18:47.450
That Doctor Gero... Just how
many artificial humans did he make?

00:18:47.530 --> 00:18:51.620
We are artificial humans, born of
the computer that Doctor Gero used,

00:18:51.700 --> 00:18:55.750
for the sole purpose of killing you.

00:18:55.830 --> 00:18:58.500
His computer? To kill me?

00:18:58.580 --> 00:19:04.840
Doctor Gero's desire for vengeance upon
you was transferred into the computer.

00:19:04.920 --> 00:19:07.300
We are what was created from
the hatred that had increased

00:19:07.380 --> 00:19:11.510
inside the computer once it
obtained the desire for vengeance.

00:19:13.510 --> 00:19:18.430
Son Goku, all of your data has
been input into the computer,

00:19:18.520 --> 00:19:20.770
and we can predict any move you make.

00:19:20.850 --> 00:19:25.440
That is why No. 15 was
able to read your every move.

00:19:25.530 --> 00:19:29.450
How can a computer make
someone's hatred grow by itself?!

00:19:29.530 --> 00:19:34.120
Kid, our only objective is to kill Son Goku.

00:19:34.200 --> 00:19:37.240
However, if you get in the way,
then that's another story!

00:19:37.330 --> 00:19:42.420
We will kill anyone that defends Son Goku!

00:19:42.500 --> 00:19:47.090
We'll see if it goes as easily as that.

00:19:47.170 --> 00:19:51.840
Let's see if you can last even a minute
with No. 14 and No. 15 as your opponents.

00:19:54.510 --> 00:19:55.430
Kuririn-san...

00:19:55.510 --> 00:19:56.890
All right!

00:20:07.530 --> 00:20:09.110
K- Kuririn-san?

00:20:09.190 --> 00:20:10.990
Awesome...

00:20:11.070 --> 00:20:14.700
We'll just have to watch how
things go from here for a little while.

00:20:14.870 --> 00:20:18.370
Son Goku, you will fight me now.

00:20:18.450 --> 00:20:23.080
All of our circuits were
built in order to defeat you.

00:20:23.170 --> 00:20:26.420
You cannot escape from this place alive.

00:20:26.500 --> 00:20:31.760
You let innocent people get caught in
the crossfire while trying to kill me?

00:20:31.840 --> 00:20:34.130
I definitely ain't letting
you get away with that!

00:21:01.250 --> 00:21:01.870
Father!

00:21:01.910 --> 00:21:05.620
Wait, Gohan!  At our power,
there's nothing we can do!

00:21:13.510 --> 00:21:14.800
Goku-san!

00:21:35.860 --> 00:21:37.780
Trunks-san!

00:22:02.600 --> 00:22:04.270
Just as I should have expected.

00:22:04.350 --> 00:22:07.900
To think that you could take that
blast of mine head-on and still be alive!

00:23:58.920 --> 00:24:00.510
Father!

00:24:00.590 --> 00:24:01.550
Gohan!

00:24:08.930 --> 00:24:13.100
Are you saying you plan to catch
the whole of my S.S. Deadly Bomber?!

00:24:13.190 --> 00:24:17.730
It has enough power to blow
away half of this planet!

00:24:38.510 --> 00:24:39.710
What?!

00:25:04.280 --> 00:25:05.530
Vegeta!

00:25:05.620 --> 00:25:06.870
Dad!

00:25:06.950 --> 00:25:12.750
Do not misunderstand, Kakarrot.
I did not come to save you.

00:25:12.830 --> 00:25:15.460
Kakarrot will be disposed
of at the hand of me,

00:25:15.540 --> 00:25:18.460
Vegeta-sama, prince of the Saiyans!

00:25:19.500 --> 00:25:22.010
Do you think I would allow
wind-up dolls such as yourselves

00:25:22.090 --> 00:25:25.090
to rob me of finishing him off?!

00:25:25.180 --> 00:25:29.430
Son Goku has yet another
traveling companion into the next world.

00:25:29.510 --> 00:25:32.310
No. 15, you take him!

00:25:54.830 --> 00:25:56.920
Let's continue, Son Goku...

00:26:31.200 --> 00:26:35.750
What's the matter, Son Goku?
I'm just barely getting warmed up!

00:26:35.830 --> 00:26:39.040
Or is it that you're
too afraid to come out?

00:26:48.840 --> 00:26:51.350
I've heard what you
guys have been saying!

00:26:51.430 --> 00:26:54.470
You underestimate our power!

00:27:35.850 --> 00:27:38.890
Don't get too carried away,
you piece of crap!

00:28:18.850 --> 00:28:20.390
Dammit!

00:28:28.860 --> 00:28:29.780
Kuririn-san!

00:28:29.860 --> 00:28:33.910
They've done it!  All three
Super Saiyans have come together!

00:29:28.170 --> 00:29:29.090
Father!

00:29:29.170 --> 00:29:30.840
Way to go, Goku!

00:29:43.180 --> 00:29:44.770
Father!

00:29:44.850 --> 00:29:46.310
Stop, Gohan!

00:29:49.520 --> 00:29:51.650
Ah!  Gohan, don't!

00:29:58.530 --> 00:29:59.660
Gohan!

00:30:05.830 --> 00:30:07.420
It's Piccolo-san!

00:30:07.500 --> 00:30:09.460
P- Piccolo?

00:30:22.520 --> 00:30:24.430
Yo, Son!

00:30:24.520 --> 00:30:27.100
It's Piccolo-san all right!

00:30:27.190 --> 00:30:28.770
Piccolo!

00:30:33.530 --> 00:30:35.440
Piccolo, I owe you one.

00:30:35.530 --> 00:30:36.780
It's not over yet.

00:30:36.860 --> 00:30:39.110
He's right.

00:30:39.200 --> 00:30:41.450
You're Piccolo, right?

00:30:41.530 --> 00:30:44.450
If you're going to interfere
in my fight with Son Goku,

00:30:44.540 --> 00:30:47.080
then I'll kill you too, while I'm at it.

00:30:47.170 --> 00:30:49.580
You expect me to let you
kill me while you're at it?

00:30:49.670 --> 00:30:52.540
You're the one who's
going to come rattling apart!

00:31:54.860 --> 00:31:58.150
You guys are nothing but
junk mannequins after all!

00:31:58.950 --> 00:32:02.780
No. 14 and No. 15
have been done in, huh?

00:33:04.590 --> 00:33:05.510
Vegeta!

00:33:05.600 --> 00:33:08.850
Kakarrot, Piccolo, you stay out of this!

00:33:08.930 --> 00:33:11.020
I'm going to dispose of this!

00:33:22.190 --> 00:33:23.490
Dad!

00:33:35.500 --> 00:33:36.960
Vegeta!

00:33:39.840 --> 00:33:42.170
Why is it always me?

00:33:45.180 --> 00:33:46.550
Dammit!

00:34:31.180 --> 00:34:32.470
Father!

00:34:35.850 --> 00:34:39.270
I will be the one who defeats Kakarrot!

00:34:41.190 --> 00:34:43.530
Goku-san!

00:35:46.510 --> 00:35:48.130
Father!

00:35:56.850 --> 00:35:57.850
Kuririn-san!

00:35:57.930 --> 00:35:59.680
You miserable monster!

00:36:04.270 --> 00:36:05.650
Take this!

00:36:13.200 --> 00:36:21.500
Kuririn-san!

00:36:37.850 --> 00:36:42.770
G- give me... your genki...

00:36:42.850 --> 00:36:48.860
Share your... genki... with me!

00:37:39.200 --> 00:37:40.330
Father!

00:37:48.840 --> 00:37:56.760
Share with me...
share with me... your genki!

00:37:56.840 --> 00:38:01.010
From the seas... from the mountains...

00:38:05.600 --> 00:38:09.360
Kakarrot belongs to me!

00:38:09.440 --> 00:38:11.820
Keep your hands off of
him without my say-so!

00:38:35.840 --> 00:38:41.470
Share all of your genki... with me!

00:38:54.860 --> 00:38:58.150
Have to let Goku-san...
make that Genki Dama...

00:39:03.620 --> 00:39:06.120
Come on, artificial human!

00:39:06.210 --> 00:39:10.500
I am he who has come from
twenty years into the future, Trunks!

00:39:13.840 --> 00:39:19.430
Twenty years from now,
on Earth, you do not exist!

00:39:19.510 --> 00:39:24.810
That is because today, here,
you will be defeated by Goku-san!

00:40:16.190 --> 00:40:21.070
Son!  Show him the power of a Super Saiyan!

00:40:27.870 --> 00:40:30.370
G- Goku, it won't work!

00:40:30.460 --> 00:40:34.080
You can't create a
Genki  Dama as a Super Saiyan!

00:40:34.170 --> 00:40:38.090
You can't create a
Genki Dama with a malicious heart!

00:42:05.930 --> 00:42:07.640
Son Goku!

00:42:14.850 --> 00:42:18.770
Son Goku! !

00:43:20.420 --> 00:43:22.040
Father!

00:43:23.250 --> 00:43:24.630
Yo!

00:43:30.930 --> 00:43:35.060
At the same time Goku
transformed into a Super Saiyan,

00:43:35.140 --> 00:43:41.440
he unconsciously drew the energy from
the dissipating Genki  Dama into himself.

00:43:41.520 --> 00:43:42.520
That has to be it!

00:43:42.610 --> 00:43:44.860
I don't even know!

00:43:44.940 --> 00:43:48.440
Kuririn-san, you did well!

00:43:48.530 --> 00:43:50.780
You did too, Trunks!

00:43:50.860 --> 00:43:53.450
This is what happens when you
don't keep active every once in a while!

00:43:53.530 --> 00:43:57.160
Oolong!  Yow-ow-ow!

00:43:58.620 --> 00:44:02.170
Don't overdo it, Kuririn!

00:44:02.250 --> 00:44:03.500
Gohan!

00:44:03.590 --> 00:44:07.380
Hurry up and get better,
so you can go to summer school!

00:44:11.260 --> 00:44:16.510
By the way, are Piccolo-san
and Vegeta-san going to be all right?

00:44:16.600 --> 00:44:18.930
It's not like they're
going to die, you know!

00:44:50.260 --> 00:44:54.890
What is it that waits for me?
No one can tell!

00:44:58.520 --> 00:45:01.350
An endless ploy,
with a thirst for blood,

00:45:01.440 --> 00:45:04.980
closes in without mercy!

00:45:07.520 --> 00:45:10.860
We rise to face
everything before our eyes,

00:45:10.940 --> 00:45:19.950
as it becomes our time!

00:45:20.040 --> 00:45:21.870
My fury (it's at its limit!),

00:45:21.960 --> 00:45:24.120
and yes, my power (it's at its limit!)

00:45:24.210 --> 00:45:26.290
My threshold (it's at its limit!),
